---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Studio administration" description="Private studio administration." admin>
<section class="admin-wrap">
<div class="admin-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow">SANDHYA VERMA / STUDIO DESK</span><h1>A little behind<br /><em>the beautiful.</em></h1></div><a class="text-link" href="/">View website ↗</a></div>
<div id="admin-notice" class="notice">Checking staff access…</div>
<p id="admin-status" class="admin-status" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p>
<div id="admin-app" hidden>
<nav class="admin-nav" aria-label="Admin sections"><button data-tab="leads" aria-pressed="true">Enquiries</button><button data-tab="content" aria-pressed="false">Content & pricing</button><button data-tab="media" aria-pressed="false">Media library</button><button data-tab="publish" aria-pressed="false">Publish</button></nav>
<section id="panel-leads" class="admin-panel"><h2>Your enquiry inbox</h2><p>Only enquiries saved by this connected environment appear here.</p><div class="admin-table-wrap"><table class="admin-table"><thead><tr><th>Received</th><th>Customer</th><th>Interest / date</th><th>Message</th><th>Status</th></tr></thead><tbody id="lead-rows"></tbody></table></div><div class="admin-actions"><button class="button button-outline" id="refresh-leads">Refresh</button><button class="button button-outline" id="next-leads" hidden>Next 50</button></div></section>
<section id="panel-content" class="admin-panel" hidden><h2>Page content & pricing</h2><p>Each section below maps to a visible website page. Edit text here; use Media library to assign uploaded images to the Home page, service cards and testimonials. Prices are stored in paise (₹1 = 100 paise); null means “Request a quote”.</p>
<div id="content-fields"></div>
<details><summary>Advanced content editor</summary><p>Use the structured editor for adding/removing services, courses or portfolio entries. IDs must be unique lowercase words separated by hyphens.</p><label class="admin-label">Full content JSON<textarea id="content-json" class="admin-editor" spellcheck="false"></textarea></label><button class="button button-outline" id="apply-json">Apply JSON to editor</button></details>
<div class="admin-actions"><button class="button" id="save-content">Save draft</button><button class="button button-outline" id="reload-content">Reload saved draft</button></div></section>
<p id="content-status" class="admin-status" role="status" aria-live="polite">Changes are saved only when you select Save draft.</p>
<section id="panel-media" class="admin-panel" hidden><h2>Media library & page placement</h2><p>Upload one or multiple compressed JPEG, PNG or WebP photos under 2 MB each. Preview them before upload, then select a page placement. Portfolio images can appear in the Home carousel; service and testimonial images only appear in their named card.</p><label class="admin-label">Choose photos<input type="file" id="media-file" accept="image/jpeg,image/png,image/webp" multiple /></label><div id="upload-preview" class="upload-preview" aria-live="polite"></div><button class="button" id="upload-media">Upload selected photos</button><label class="admin-label">Selected placement<select id="media-target"></select></label><p class="form-note">To remove a photo from a page, choose that placement and use the matching button on its preview. Save draft afterwards. Library deletion is available only after all placements are removed.</p><p id="media-budget" class="form-note"></p><div id="media-items" class="media-grid"></div></section>
<section id="panel-publish" class="admin-panel" hidden><h2>From draft to live</h2><p>First save your content draft. Then Publish sends that saved draft to Cloudflare for a new production build. Your changes go live automatically once Cloudflare shows the build as successful — normally within a few minutes. No other action is needed.</p><div class="notice">After you publish, look for the latest entry below to show <strong>queued</strong>, then check Cloudflare Pages if you need the final build result. The live website is not changed if the build fails.</div><button class="button" id="publish-content">Publish saved draft ↗</button><div id="publication-list"></div></section>
</div>
</section>
<script>import '../../scripts/admin';</script>
</Layout>
